transform.py follows the import rewiring and span cutting of tools/prune.py from keithadler/rh-trim
(https://github.com/keithadler/rh-trim, Apache-2.0), with changes. It reads keep lists by declaration, applies edit
lists (edits.py, EDIT-LISTS.md), refuses edits inside the statement cone, and keeps imports in their original order.
